{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of Solasta: Crown of the Magister comes another intriguing tactical RPG faithful to the world's most popular TTRPG's ruleset.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.poster.avif?t=1773332597\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.webm?t=1773332597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.mp4?t=1773332597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/496910ba862f20e8926c24cb6554ae67.avif?t=1773332597\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and guide your party of 4 adventurers as they head to the faraway continent of Neokos in a quest driven by their family legacy. In the face of the threat by the ancient and enigmatic Shadwyn, what choices will you make to push back the impending tide of corruption?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II is a grand sequel to Solasta: Crown of the Magister, a much beloved Tactical RPG known for its faithfulness to the Tabletop experience. Decades after defeating the Sorak menace, a new flegdling party of heroes travels to distant lands in search for redemption.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.poster.avif?t=1773332597\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.webm?t=1773332597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.mp4?t=1773332597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/f15a8eeedc128a4b36d1696866dbfab0.avif?t=1773332597\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II remains true to its promise to deliver gameplay based on the world's most popular TTRPG. Prepare your spells, land that sneak attack, smite this monster - bathe in the familiarity of your Tabletop experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not all Solasta II will have to offer. This new opus will also allow you to freely roam the lands of Neokos, to explore and uncover the map as you will. Whether you stick to familiar roads, or head off into the wilderness... The choice is yours. Just be careful - because as we've always said...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You make the choices, dice decide your destiny.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2975950?t=1773332597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773332597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/af1dc02431cdfae5c644773cc0714a8128b45fc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773332597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/af1dc02431cdfae5c644773cc0714a8128b45fc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773332597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Use of Alcohol\r\nBlood\r\nSuggestive Themes\r\nViolence\r\nLanguage"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Launch Content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/4674ed24a42199293f49f5bb0c3e8e45.avif?t=1773332597\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras_big/4674ed24a42199293f49f5bb0c3e8e45.avif?t=1773332597 width=1560 height=950 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/4d68522ed842f1fcf6c452ee45c37c96.avif?t=1773332597\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras_big/4d68522ed842f1fcf6c452ee45c37c96.webp?t=1773332597 width=1560 height=769 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This roadmap presents the Early Access plan as of March 2026 and does not include all planned content.<br>Features and updates not yet implemented are subject to change and evolve.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of Solasta: Crown of the Magister comes another intriguing tactical RPG faithful to the world's most popular TTRPG's ruleset.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e